Z||000003||Rogue_Ant||07-27-2001||10:28 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by saleenfiero:<BR><B>Well if you have to ask, I roll up next to one and know I'm gonna get blown away.  Light turns green, I mash it anyway, use my torque to get ahead 15 feet or so and then VTEC kicks in.  Nuff said<BR></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Lol, nice try, um just wondering what did you have?  The S2000 has 240hp @ 8300rpm, 6-Speed Close-Ratio tranny, and a Torque-Sensing Limited-Slip Differential. <A HREF="http://www.honda2001.com/models/s2000/features.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.honda2001.com/models/s2000/features.html</A> <P>Rogue<BR>||||reg||1
